      "en": "For he sacrificed to the gods of Damascus which had defeated him. He said, “Because the gods of the kings of Syria helped them, I will sacrifice to them, that they may help me.” But they were the ruin of him and of all Israel.",
      "ko": "자기를 친 다메섹 신들에게 제사하여 가로되 아람 열왕의 신들이 저희를 도왔으니 나도 그 신에게 제사하여 나를 돕게 하리라 하였으나 그 신이 아하스와 온 이스라엘을 망케 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "9955730adcb9a801afb710e361c1b6a7d3fd27fa5797e4587fef2926116bdc09",
      "translation_text_hash": "3e7b1ba555777448c1bffc314c480353c701a5a2b99cb0794ff19a764d1a7f01",
